{"attachment": {"content": {"file": {"content": "# RAINBOW — NEW 11-SCREEN CLAUDE CODE MASTER BUILD PROMPT\n\n**MANDATE: BUILD A BRAND-NEW RAINBOW GAME FROM THESE EXACT APPROVED REFERENCES.** This is a new isolated project. Do not modify, copy, fork, overwrite, or reuse repositories, assets, models, scenes, characters, code, or branches from Bubble Wash Kingdom, Ripple, bubblegames, or any other earlier project. The only approved source files are the 11 image references and official new cartoon-girl reference shipped in THIS package.\n\n**Project title:** RAINBOW. **Proposed private GitHub repo:** `rainbow-washer-game` (use this name if available; if it exists, DO NOT overwrite or clone old content; report the collision and use an explicitly confirmed new name). Verify any new remote, default branch, first commit SHA and push, and tell me what was actually created. If no GitHub access exists, keep working locally and clearly report the authentication blocker rather than claiming a push.\n\n## 0. FIRST ACTION: READ THE SOURCES AND KEEP THEM IMMUTABLE\n\nRead `README_FIRST.md`, `REFERENCE_ORDER.md`, `character_references/official_cartoon_girl_original.jpg`, and *all eleven* files in `references/` at full resolution BEFORE designing anything. These images are locked targets, NOT broad inspiration. Preserve the originals byte-for-byte. Check the SHA-256 list and native dimensions in `REFERENCE_ORDER.md`. There is no 12th stage.\n\nThe new official cartoon girl is a **mandatory, narrowly scoped visual override** of the previously pictured human characters. Use HER in the opening, when the girl is visible behind the door in Scene 10, and in the real final Scene 11. **The girl visible in the uploaded Scene 11 image is NOT the identity to model; it is a reference for composition, towel, environment and final UI only.** Do not mix their heads, outfits, hairstyles or proportions. Keep Benny unchanged. Everything else in 01–11 stays as close to the original reference as a real-time 3D build allows.\n\n**Hard rule:** deliver a real controllable 3D game on Android, not a slide show, static screenshot, video, skybox, wallpaper or pre-rendered film being presented as gameplay. The cinematic start and victory ending may use real-time cutscenes, but the ride itself must run on 3D geometry with steering/swimming, coin collection, moving water and camera/path continuity.\n\n## 1. OFFICIAL CHARACTERS — DO NOT REDESIGN\n\n**Benny:** ONE reusable, rigged 3D version of the exact pink fluffy round mascot from the source photos. Retain soft pink fur, proportions, violet eyes, rosy cheeks, little paw pads, purple-and-white ribbed/knitted beanie with a big deep-purple pom-pom and gold star on the side. He is cute, alive, reactive, able to kick/swim/paddle, tumble and ride currents. Do not replace him with another pink creature; use the SAME geometry, materials, fur style, rig, hat and star in front/rear views through ALL scenes. Rear camera on travel stages, not head-on. Benny is never seen by the girl.\n\n**Official cartoon girl, overriding the old girls:** One and only ONE rigged girl model based on `character_references/official_cartoon_girl_original.jpg`. Her distinctive silhouette is curly dark/warm-brown high ponytail, purple headband tied into a big purple bow with a small gold/yellow star, large cartoon eyes, friendly rounded face, warm smile, gold hoop earrings, lavender-and-white horizontally striped hoodie with gold star on sleeve, blue jeans with cuffed legs and prominent star-patch pocket, purple/white sneakers with yellow star details. Maintain the same facial proportions, hair silhouette, costume, colors, materials, age-neutral childlike cartoon proportions and art direction across all appearances. The high-quality, soft, warm, colorful 3D animated look must suit Benny. **Avoid photorealistic faces, lifelike skin, semi-realistic women, or a different-looking girl in Scene 11.** Make her recognizable even from behind or seen through glass. A single front/side/back turntable and consistent rig are required before scene integration.\n\n**Opening continuity:** She sorts/handles laundry, carries or pours a load containing Benny concealed in the purple towel into the washer, closes the door, and walks away at normal human speed. Benny stays concealed until she cannot see him; if he peeks in Scene 01, she is already walking away. Her walk, hands, blinking, cloth grasp, clothing movement and towel interaction must be smooth, casual and non-robotic. Do not show her noticing Benny. This opening action may occur *before* the first locked screenshot checkpoint without introducing another numbered screen.\n\n**Ending continuity:** In Scene 10, same cartoon girl is visible through the washer door/window, unaware of Benny. In Scene 11, she opens the metallic door, leans in and retrieves/holds the folded purple towel from the perforated platform while Benny stays safely hidden inside it. Match the approved final shot's camera, shelf, open door, violet towel, golden trim and `FINAL SPIN COMPLETE` victory badge—but substitute the official cartoon girl, including her signature bow, striped hoodie and hair. Never change back to the more realistic girl pictured in the original Stage 11. Keep the final happy and cohesive with the introduction.\n\n## 2. LOCKED SCENES IN EXACT CHRONOLOGICAL ORDER\n\nThe numbering below corresponds directly to the original filenames and files. Do not rename stages, merge stages, insert unrelated environments or skip transitions. Match each image's shapes, colors, object placement, camera scale, framing, lighting, foam, reflections and UI.\n\n**01 — Inside the Washing Machine** (`01_inside_washer_girl_and_towel.png`). Cinematic without HUD. Camera INSIDE glossy perforated pink-magenta gold-rimmed drum facing the round washer opening. The **official cartoon girl** is visible walking away in the bright laundry room, purple towel conceals Benny, glossy cyan and pink waves lift floating blue-and-white sock and pink T-shirt with yellow star. Sparkly bubbles, reflective gold washers and rich texture. Intro must lead physically into Scene 02.\n\n**02 — Whirlpool Tumble** (`02_mascot_tumbles_in_whirlpool.png`). Same drum from a dynamic angle, liquid sweeps in a large clockwise-like swirl; Benny tumbles with spiral eyes, visible paws, purple towel, blue striped sock, pink star T-shirt. Keep her out of Benny's view. No HUD. His tumble must naturally join the funnel opening of Scene 03.\n\n**03 · WHIRLPOOL TWIRL** (`03_whirlpool_twirl.png`). HUD hearts 5/5, $ 1,330, pause; level strip same title. Polished cyan/hot-pink spiral, round gold door/rings, foam and bubbles, Benny foreground near whirlpool, gold $ tokens, visible glowing drain and narrow cyan five-arrow exit slide at bottom. Source screenshot includes a decorative exterior phone border—match the **in-game content**, not a permanent extra phone-shaped frame.\n\n**04 · THROUGH THE FIVE ARROWS** (`04_through_the_five_arrows.png`). From the SAME drain, Benny shoots onto a steep blue water ramp with EXACTLY FIVE glowing white chevrons. Camera behind/above Benny, large foreground character and long descending tunnel perspective. Concentric gold ring pipe, magenta water edges, white foam, $ tokens following left edge. HUD 5/5, $ 1,330.\n\n**05 · FLOW INTO THE CURRENT** (`05_flow_into_the_current.png`). Slide settles seamlessly into a winding horizontal S-shaped current in a perforated magenta metal tube lined with gold ribs and washer nozzles. Benny centered rear view, ribbon of blue water with pink sides, many bubbles and $ coins. HUD 5/5, $ 1,420. Keep forward swimming sensation fast but controllable.\n\n**06 · CREST THE RINSE ARCH** (`06_crest_the_rinse_arch.png`). Current rises into a large sweeping wave arch, crests and curls downward into the next ringed tunnel. Gold dollar coins must sit ON the curve of water; iridescent bubbles, white foam fringes, gold hoops. Rear camera with tilt adapting naturally to