nd positions for placing the towel** (wrists, in her local frame):\n\n| Pose | Left hand | Right hand |\n|---|---|---|\n| `leanReachTowel` (end pose) | (3.64, 9.8, 4.87) | (−3.64, 9.8, 4.87) |\n| `holdTowel` | (±3.9, 14.3, 4.6) | |\n\nFor scene 11, a folded towel with its top at about y 9–9.5 and z 5–6 in her frame sits under her palms.\n\n**What matches the reference**\n- High, voluminous curly ponytail in warm brown, with a purple hair tie and curls at the temples; it reads clearly from behind and from the side.\n- Hair pulled back from a soft arched hairline.\n- Big puffy purple bow on the headband with a yellow star.\n- Large warm-brown eyes with highlights, thick lashes with corner flicks, rosy cheeks, an open smile, small nose.\n- Gold hoop earrings.\n- Lavender-and-white striped hoodie with the hood bunched at the back, white ribbed hem and cuffs, zipper, drawstrings, and a star patch on her right upper sleeve.\n- Cuffed jeans with a yellow-star cargo pocket on the right thigh.\n- Purple-and-white sneakers with yellow stars, white soles and laces, white socks.\n- Eyes are real openings cut into the head rather than bulging domes (my first three attempts had visible rings or domes). Blinking uses a lid shape behind each opening.\n\n**What differs or is limited**\n- The rig is rigid parts on joints, not skin-weighted, so very deep bends would show seams; the clips stay within safe angles.\n- She has one facial expression (the happy smile), no lip movement, and she looks straight ahead (the reference glances sideways).\n- Hands are simple, with no finger joints.\n- About 30k of the triangles are the ponytail curls. There's no lower-detail version, so she should be hidden during the ride.\n- Colours read a little pinker and more violet under the game's candy lighting than in the reference's daylight.\n\n**Changes needed to shared files:** none.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>490098</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>58</tool_uses><duration_ms>1832427</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>", "deliveryId": "e6bff6d6-76df-44be-b7bd-cf8f96301377", "operation": "remove", "reason": "absorbed_mid_turn", "sessionId": "515c677b-ab06-5e2e-a8b1-8f1fec6cb7a1", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T17:24:59.199Z", "type": "queue-operation"}
